    "title": "3 Prichard high school football players commit to college programs in August 2026",
    "text": "3 Prichard high school football players commit to college programs in August 2026\nBy\nA. C. SimsThree football players from Prichard, Alabama, high schools committed to play college football in August 2026, according to Prep Redzone.\nAll three commitments came from Vigor High School.\nThe three Vigor players committed to different colleges: the University of Texas at Austin, Kentucky and Arkansas State University.\nVigor players Jabarrius Garror, Miguel Wilson and Zy Wilson committed, respectively, to the University of Texas at Austin, Kentucky and Arkansas State University.\nFootball commitments listed by Prep Redzone for players from Prichard, AL high school, August 2026\n| Player | High school | College | Commitment date | Position |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n|\nMiguel WilsonZy WilsonAll commitment information in this article is reported by Prep Redzone.",
    "summary": "3 Prichard high school football players commit to college programs in August 2026 A. C. SimsThree football players from Prichard, Alabama, high schools committed to play college football in August 2026, according to Prep Redzone. All three commitments came from Vigor High School. The three Vigor players committed to different colleges: the University of Texas at Austin, Kentucky and Arkansas State University. Vigor players Jabarrius Garror, Miguel Wilson and Zy Wilson committed, respectively, to the University of Texas at Austin, Kentucky and Arkansas State University.",
